From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <173511395+At30c@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:20:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Disable unsupported satellite carrier lookups on Exynos 990

Legacy Exynos 990 devices have no satellite radio. Android 17 nevertheless
queries carrier NTN configuration after ordinary cellular updates, repeatedly
parsing a configuration that can never exist and flooding telephony logs.
Return the terrestrial defaults before those configuration lookups.
---
--- a/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/satellite/SatelliteController.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/satellite/SatelliteController.smali
@@ -14055,28 +14055,15 @@
 .end method
 
 .method private blacklist isSatelliteAttachSupportedViaConfigupdater(I)Ljava/lang/Boolean;
-    .locals 0
-
